Distribution: resolute
Urgency: medium
Maintainer: Debian Cinnamon Team <debian-cinnamon@lists.debian.org>
Changed-By: Ubuntu Unity Life Support <mihail.rozshko@gmail.com>
Description:
 cinnamon-session - Cinnamon Session Manager - Minimal runtime
 cinnamon-session-common - Cinnamon Session Manager - common files
Changes:
 cinnamon-session (6.4.2-1+unity5) resolute; urgency=medium
 .
   * Take only this user's open graphical logind session as the session
     behind SessionIsActive and the idle hint (new patch
     Take-only-this-user-s-open-graphical-session): each candidate must be
     owned by the user, active or online, of class user (the process's own
     session may also be a greeter) and of type x11, wayland or mir.
     Rejections are logged at debug level.
   * Handle a missing or removed logind session in the systemd backend (new
     patch Handle-a-missing-or-removed-logind-session-in-the-systemd):
     switching users no longer reads an unset seat when no session was found,
     the idle hint is not sent without a session, and a removed session is
     logged and no longer called.
